# Google Cloud Vertex AI Configuration
GOOGLE_CLOUD_PROJECT_ID=<your project_id>
GOOGLE_CLOUD_LOCATION=us-central1
GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS=<path to your credentials json file>
VERTEX_AI_MODEL=gemini-2.5-pro
AI_PROMPT=Find the key characteristics of the people in the video: gender, age, height, hair characteristics or baldness, clothing, and special features. List only the characteristics, nothing else. Example: Persons’ characteristics Person 1: gender: male, age: 40–50, height: 180–190, hair: brown and short, clothing: blue t-shirt and black shorts, special features: tattoos. Person 2: gender: male, age: 20–30, height: 170–180, hair: white and long, clothing: blue jeans and red jacket, special features: scar on the face.

# Frontend Configuration
NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_TITLE=AI Characteristics Application
NEXT_PUBLIC_GUIDE_TEXT=Upload a video and our AI will analyze it for you